WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.420
Pick up a magnifying glass, and look
through it at the world around you.

2
00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:07.940
Sometimes the view is
larger, and the right way up.

3
00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:11.600
Sometimes it is smaller,
and flipped upside down.

4
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:15.190
One magnifying glass,
two very different views.

5
00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.510
What decides which one you see?

6
00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:20.340
In this mission, you'll
meet two kinds of lens,

7
00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:23.800
and find where rays
parallel to the axis meet.

8
00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:28.640
Then you'll draw ray diagrams, and
tell a real image from a virtual one.

9
00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:33.880
Your mission: find out what decides whether
the image is upside down or upright.
